  "summary": {
    "text": "GPT-6.1 Sol is the first model of OpenAI's GPT-6.1 family, a reasoning language model for text and image input released on 29 September 2026 in the API and in ChatGPT Work and Codex for paid and Edu plans. OpenAI presents it as an upgrade to GPT-6 Sol at a fifth of GPT-6 Astra's standard token prices, and rates it Critical in cybersecurity.",
