  "notes": "The system card addendum calls GPT-6.1 the latest model family in the GPT-6 series. At launch it rolled out to Plus, Pro, Business, Enterprise and Edu in Codex and ChatGPT Work, not to ChatGPT conversations and not to Free and Go. Codex CLI 0.159.1 added it to its Amazon Bedrock catalogs (ChatGPT and Codex changelog, 2026-09-29), but OpenAI’s Bedrock guide did not list it on 2026-10-01, so cloud-partner is left out. The launch page shows no publication date; Sep 29, 2026 comes from the API changelog and the system card addendum. The openai.com post was read through a Wayback Machine capture."
